  "notes": "Target unavailable. The document does not publish a table of 'Sample Probability of Death' or 'Rates of Mortality' with specific numerical values for single ages or 5-year bands. Instead, it describes the mortality assumptions textually (Page 112), stating that the RP-2014 Healthy Annuitant Mortality Table (with 111% male/110% female scaling) and RP-2014 Disability Mortality Table (with 102% male/98% female scaling), projected with Scale MP-2016, were used. The document provides illustrative rates for Termination (Page 113), Retirement (Page 114), and Disability (Page 115), but these are decrement rates for those specific events, not the probability of death (mortality) required for the target. No sample mortality rates are printed to be transcribed or blended."
